From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 22:14:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] chore: Add helpers to filter and highlight canned
 responses

Add filterCannedResponses, which matches the search key against both the
short code and the content (case-insensitive) and ranks short code prefix
matches first, followed by short code and content matches.

Add getHighlightedSegments, which splits a text into matching and
non-matching segments so the match can be highlighted in templates
without v-html.

Also add isArrowUp/isArrowDown keyboard helpers.
